@startuml UC11_LintGovernance_Seq
skinparam SequenceArrowColor #64748B
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #94A3B8

title UC11 — Lint bundle theo governance rules (Spectral)

participant "Backend" as BE
participant "Spectral CLI" as Spectral
participant "File System" as FS

BE -> Spectral: subprocess.run(\n"spectral lint dist/openapi-bundled.yaml"\n)

Spectral -> Spectral: Load project ruleset

alt Ruleset không tìm thấy
  Spectral --> BE: exit 1\n{ error: "Ruleset config error" }
  BE -> BE: Bỏ qua kết quả Spectral\nChỉ dùng kết quả Redocly
else Ruleset tìm thấy
  Spectral -> FS: Đọc dist/openapi-bundled.yaml
  FS --> Spectral: YAML content

  Spectral -> Spectral: Kiểm tra từng rule:\n- operationId camelCase\n- Không dùng inline schema\n- Error response dùng $ref chuẩn\n- server-managed fields phải readOnly

  Spectral --> BE: issues[]\n{ code, message,\n  severity: 0=error/1=warning,\n  path }
  BE -> BE: Tổng hợp kết quả\nTrả về cho frontend
end

@enduml
